flowchart TD
    C[Client / DBX SDK] --> API[API Layer: RESP Parser / HTTP / gRPC]
    API --> SEC[Security: Rate Limit → ACL → Tenant Quota]
    SEC --> QR[Query Router / Planner]
    QR --> CL[Cluster Lookup: Consistent Hash Ring → Slot Allocator]
    CL -->|wrong shard| RD[Redirect / MOVED]
    RD --> C
    CL -->|correct shard| TXN[Transaction Layer: WATCH/MULTI/EXEC → Lock Manager]
    TXN --> MVCC[MVCC Version Manager]
    MVCC --> ADM[Admission Control]
    ADM --> ENG[Engine: In-Memory KV
    string/hash/list/set/zset/stream/doc/bitmap/geo]

    ENG --> WAL[Persistence: WAL Writer]
    WAL --> SNAP[Snapshotter]
    WAL --> CKSUM[Checksum + Recovery]
    SNAP --> BACKUP[Backup Archive Store]

    WAL --> REPL[Replication: Sync Stream]
    REPL --> REPLICA[Replica Nodes]
    REPLICA --> LAG[Lag Monitor / ACK]
    REPLICA --> FAILOVER[Failover Coordinator]
    FAILOVER --> RAFT[Raft Metadata Quorum]

    RAFT --> MEMBER[Cluster Membership / Topology]
    MEMBER --> REBAL[Rebalancer]
    REBAL --> CL

    ENG --> POLICY[Policy Engine: TTL / Eviction / Retention]
    POLICY --> SCHED[Background Scheduler]
    SCHED --> COMPACT[Compactor]
    SCHED --> REAPER[Expiration Reaper]
    SCHED --> TIER[Hot/Cold Tiering]
    TIER --> NVME[NVMe Spillover Store]

    ENG --> EVT[Events: Pub/Sub]
    EVT --> DSTREAM[Durable Stream Store]
    DSTREAM --> CGROUP[Consumer Group Coordinator]
    CGROUP --> ACK[Stream Ack / Replay]

    ENG --> WF[Workflow: Delayed Job Scheduler]
    WF --> RETRY[Retry Queue]
    RETRY --> DLQ[Dead Letter Queue]

    ENG --> VER[Versioning: Time-Travel Index / History]

    ENG --> AUDIT[Audit Logger — Immutable]
    SEC --> AUDIT

    API --> OBS[Observability]
    ENG --> OBS
    REPL --> OBS
    EVT --> OBS
    WF --> OBS
    OBS --> METRICS[Metrics Collector]
    OBS --> TRACE[Distributed Trace Service]
    METRICS --> ALERT[Alert Manager]
    TRACE --> ALERT
    OBS --> PLUGIN[Plugin Hook Runtime]
